      "His validity test (HTTP 200 within two seconds) was never adopted: update_depot.stream_evidence decides, so a geo-locked or IPv6-only stream is recorded as untestable and kept.",
      "host_groups and pinned_channels are human judgements about which domains a viewer reaches without a proxy. They are declared here, not scraped from the previous output, or every rebuild would be learning from a machine-generated file."
    ]
